* NE5532 low-noise bipolar dual op-amp, ±18 V max (our model from onsemi's and TI's sheets)
* Built by Solum Builder from onsemi NE5532/D Rev. 2 (September 2013) and TI NE5532 data sheet SLOS075K (revised December 2025), NE5532 at ±15 V (D-162)
.subckt NE5532 1 2 3 4 5
* pins: + - V+ V- out. Built by Solum Builder from the sheet's typical figures (D-162)
Rin 1 2 1e+12
Rc1 1 mid 1e12
Rc2 2 mid 1e12
Emid mid 4 3 4 0.5
Bgm mid g I=1e-05*tanh(7.68437*(V(1)-V(2)))
R1 g mid 1.30134e+09
C1 g mid 1.11111e-12
Vhp 3 hp DC 1.27
Vhn hn 4 DC 1.27
Dhi g hp DCLAMP
Dlo hn g DCLAMP
Ebuf b 0 g 0 1
Rp b p 1000
Cp p 0 7.32031e-12
Eout o 0 p 0 1
Vsense o o2 0
Rout o2 5 33.5
Bsrc 3 0 I=max(i(Vsense),0)
Bsnk 0 4 I=max(-i(Vsense),0)
Iq 3 4 DC 0.004
.model DCLAMP D(is=1e-15 n=0.05)
.ends
